# Media the server never reads. Kept in git for the local agents, but baking
# ~330 MB of ad videos/images into every Railway image only slows builds and
# deploys. Outreach/watch videos are served from R2, not from disk
# (outreach_video.py, routers/watch.py). Binary media only: text files in
# these folders stay so the OS agents can still read them. design-agent/ is
# deliberately NOT touched: client_autosetup.py runs its tools/ + references/.
dashboard/backend/watch_uploads/
media-buying-agent/**/*.mp4
media-buying-agent/**/*.mov
media-buying-agent/**/*.webm
media-buying-agent/**/*.png
media-buying-agent/**/*.jpg
media-buying-agent/**/*.jpeg
content-agent/**/*.mp4
content-agent/**/*.mov
content-agent/**/*.webm
content-agent/tmp/
.git/
.claude/worktrees/
